    <string name="onboard_init_prompt">Let us start a new book together: read ideas.md and CREATOR.md first, then work through premise, genre, conflict, world, characters and writing rules through conversation. Ask when information is missing and keep interim conclusions in ideas.md. For now do not create outlines, chapters or lore entries.</string>
    <string name="onboard_first_prompt">Create the first chapter markdown for %1$s with an opening that can keep growing. Focus on the opening scene, the protagonist state and the first suspense; keep the body around 800-1200 words and write it under chapters/. Summarize which files you created or changed.</string>
